Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather is so nice today. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's so peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at those Goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a monster in sight. Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time to be daydreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been traveling for eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the world are\Nthese guys taking me?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.19,0:00:58.53,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.09,0:02:00.09,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(98,55)\fad(734,1)\fsp5.4}Boxxo Is Abducted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The director contracted\Nus for a large-scale
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,project to reinforce the\Nvillage wall starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he asked us to take\Nyou there so you could set
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up shop on the construction\Nsite to help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.11,0:02:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the guy who tried to steal\Nmoney from me during the expedition?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he turned over a new\Nleaf and got some honest work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if Director Bear hired\Nthem, it should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, right? Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait just a moment, it will\Nget you where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful not to drop him. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're good to go. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.04,0:02:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more I think about\Nthis whole situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to realize I should have been\Na little more suspicious of their story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, how much\Nfarther are we going to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well double-check\Nmy points to be safe.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.07,0:02:56.94,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (middle line),0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(155,20)\bord0\blur10\t(1,438,\blur0)}<Function> Keep Cold • Keep Warm\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hBlessing • Barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could use my barrier, but it\Nwouldn't even last for three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I kind of regret going\Nthat wild with my spending
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after I earned a whole bunch\Nof points in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop. We'll break here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm sore all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go take a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.50,0:03:21.72,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H8E958D&\3c&HB2C7A4&\fs25}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll record these guys' faces\Nwith my security camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.38,0:03:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember me, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a small-time crook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was a fool for thinking he reformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now, I'm sure you\Nunderstand the whole situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cooperate and spit\Nout some goodies or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not have a brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but even you should know what'll happen\Nif you don't do exactly as we say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad. What, fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to learn the hard way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Durability has been\Ndecreased by one. Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though our main goal is the money inside,\Nthe box itself should be worth something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:04:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lower its selling price.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.52,0:04:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.43,0:04:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, boss. And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.46,0:04:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be a real shame if you got busted up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be easier for everyone\Nif you did what you're told.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give you the option\Nto not get hurt, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did I hear you right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that it can fix any damage it takes\Nyep i watched it get pretty banged up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now it's in perfect condition it's\Ndefinitely got a recovery skill all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right you can use force as long as you\Ndon't break it you got it boss come
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On, let's get started, boys! Like this,\Nyou're like giving up, you stupid boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,durability has been decreased by three\Nall in all these guys aren't doing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that much damage to me but I hate the\Nfact I have to sit here and just take
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it too would you like to spend 1,000\Npoints to increase your toughness
