Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:05:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my stats that's new did it get harder
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damage taken, zero. Great!\NNo more damage for me. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's probably enough for\Nnow. Uh, yes, sir. Hey, you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,said it fix itself huh no\Nway i swear i saw it do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it come on repair yourself\Nalready goyle you know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what'll happen to you if\Nthis thing is broken don't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you hey you wake up i know\Nyou're just pretending
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't fix see here\Nit's fine boss the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this? Who knows? Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.64,0:05:35.10,sign_7952_95_Weili__The_futur,text (top/large),0,0,0,,Weili\N{\b1\c&HDCE9EF&\fs8} The futuristic super health drink that's\Nfinally come from that planet! For those\Nwilling to risk everything for health!\N\N\NCarbonated beverage  Contains no fruit juice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It tastes like shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like the taste of one of the\Njuices that ranks in my ten worst products?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it inside so our\Nguests can check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But boss, what do we do if they\Nrefuse to take a look at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't get such a simple task\Ndone, I swear your heads are gonna roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Count on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like there's someone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss really doesn't let up, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we brought you something interesting,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so give it a once-over\Nand tell us what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you\Nthink you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about an attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a shitty little peon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.49,0:06:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a woman, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think\Nyou can order me around?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's all the info we have on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you read through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are your manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't your mother teach you to look people\Nin the eye when you're talking to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you seem like a mama's boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be you're\Nscared of little old me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing you're any\Ngood at is running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you really\Na sentient magic item?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be too much of a\Nrisk to tell her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have introduced myself first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.63,0:07:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I may not look it,\Nbut I'm a magic item engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the reason they kidnapped\Nme was so I could study you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.55,0:07:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the person Lamas wanted me to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can really talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a magic item that can\Ncomprehend human speech before. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says here that\Nparticular phrase means yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a strange twist of fate\Nfor us to run into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've actually experimented with trying to\Nendow magic items with human intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the end, I've concluded\Nit's currently impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then I changed up\Nthe way I approached it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.36,0:07:50.82,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (right side),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H95A6AA&\3c&HCADCE2&\fs25}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.36,0:07:50.82,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (left side),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H9AB7BE&\3c&HACD5E0&\fs25}Early Afternoon Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of giving a magic\Nitem human intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that I'd try\Nto put a human soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inside a magic item, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, she came up with\Nthat idea all on her own?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't usually get that worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get something to cool off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this drink for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help myself then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.46,0:08:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you open this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so refreshing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect pick-me-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you did it,\Nbut it's pleasantly warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.18,0:08:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got a totally different\Nvibe when she smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's like a regular innocent girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your name is Boxxo? Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're clearly sentient.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a magic item that's had\Na human soul placed inside it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you can only respond yes\Nor no, I'll do the talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you tell me if I've got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a magic item, so do you\Nhave a master somewhere? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.94,0:09:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, free agent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any memories\Nfrom when you were human?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, magic items aren't\Nsupposed to require money to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that you charge\Nmakes you even more special.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be you need money to replenish\Nyour inventory? Hello there. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not wrong, but not\Ncompletely correct either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you have some\Nother use for the money you earn?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be quicker to\Njust show her what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it looks like the goods\Nyou're selling are different too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I weren't a vending machine, this\Nwould be a super awkward situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what you use the money on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.06,0:09:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can somehow spend\Nit to change your form.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there! How cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What other secrets you got\Ninside that metal frame?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd say a pretty sturdy one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.48,0:10:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for a little surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A solid wall where you can\Ncontrol what passes through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a barrier, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only can you change your form,\Nbut you can even use a blessing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are way beyond any\Nordinary magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I appreciate the compliment,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all I did was die and get this\Nawesome vending machine body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's actually impressive\Nhere is her intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's connecting all the dots and\Npretty much figuring it out by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if anybody back in the\Nvillage has noticed that I'm missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:11:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Lamas doesn't get too worried\Nand end up doing something reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Auxo's all fixed up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like she's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That smart-ass little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we teach her a lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to attack her while\Nshe's totally defenseless?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on What's going on with the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do something back in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My tummy hurts. I'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good at taking that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm glad it worked out, but I\Nreally don't feel good about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Food time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, what's with this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If food's here, it must\Nbe morning already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those jerks never give me anything good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I can't trust them\Nnot to slip something
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weird into my food so I\Nhaven't been eating much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh you changed your wares again.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.44,0:12:42.40,sign_29945_459_Oden,text,0,0,0,,{\b0\c&H192221&\3c&H939CAF&\bord2}Anpan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this bread boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I glad to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it so soft and fluffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.26,0:12:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With food as good as this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you'd put all the\Nrestaurants around out of business.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.00,0:12:56.08,sign_29945_459_Oden,text (left),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H161F1B&\fs30}Oden
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.00,0:12:56.08,sign_18534_230_Gutenburger,text (center),0,0,0,,Gutenburger
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ended up eating way\Ntoo much. I'm stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.90,0:13:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you figured out\Nanything about this box yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't take orders from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.20,0:13:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A word of warning, I'm not a patient man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got two days to find a way to open\Nup this box and get the money out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we're on a time limit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to make our escape before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.58,0:13:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kulami's hair is a crazy mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no bath here for her to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that another gift for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really owe you a lot, Oxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I can eat and drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.14,0:14:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's way warmer than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to drink it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad. You could use your\Nhead. Did you say head? Head?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,head are you telling\Nme to use these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To wash my hair oh yeah\Ni haven't had a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.46,0:14:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to wash at all since those\Njerks locked me up in
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.45,0:14:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the kind of\Nsituation I wanted to foster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reincarnation is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make sure it's\Nperfectly clear that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bought women's underwear\Npurely by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like a new person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the deadline\NMinus tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.22,0:15:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can create some kind of\Ndistraction while Hulemy runs away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.14,0:15:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if we talk about\Nsomething serious here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.29,0:15:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're thinking of trying to sacrifice\Nyourself so I can escape, just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are hordes of monsters\Nthat live in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a fighter, so I'd give myself\Na few days at most before I got eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why escaping from here\Nalone has never been an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to keep putting up\Nwith this and wait for our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, at worst,\Nwe'll die. Not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it might be for others, but I've\Ngrown numb to that particular fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine what she's\Nexperienced to feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading off to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:15:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got a real talent\Nfor falling asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our opportunity\Nto get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to wake Hulemy up!\NYou could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could even win a reward\Nyou could even win a reward
